{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfvaz3CiMsq1G86G38EK3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Default to sunsetting. Interview the four accounts only as part of the deprecation notice, not as a way to decide whether to rebuild.**\n\n**The numbers**\n- The rebuild costs about 30 engineer-days.\n- Maintenance costs about 2 days a month, so about 10 days before the API dies. After that it's moot, because the old integration stops working either way.\n- The rebuild only pays back against maintenance if the new integration runs for well over a year. That's a weak case. The real question is whether four accounts (0.13% of the base) justify roughly 30 engineer-days.\n\n**Why interviews are the wrong tool**\nCustomers will say they want to keep a feature that's free to them. Their stated preference tells you little. What matters is:\n1. **Revenue and risk.** What is the combined ARR of the four accounts, and are any strategic, expanding, or up for renewal soon? Compare that to the loaded cost of 30 engineer-days.\n2. **Substitutes.** Can they move to an email integration you already support, or to generic SMTP/BCC logging? How painful is that for them?\n3. **Hidden demand.** Do prospects or sales deals ask for this provider? Four active accounts in 90 days suggests not, but check with sales.\n4. **Usage depth.** Is it core to their workflow, or a light sync?\n\nAll of this is available from billing and usage data in a day or two.\n\n**Recommendation**\n1. Pull that data now.\n2. If the combined ARR is modest and there's a substitute, announce the deprecation with a migration path and a date comfortably before the shutdown.\n3. Use the conversations with the four accounts to ease the migration and to catch a surprise, like a large account that depends on it.\n4. Rebuild only if the revenue at risk clearly exceeds the cost, or one account is strategic.\n5. Decide within a few weeks, since five months is tight for a rebuild plus customer notice."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3203,"cache_read_input_tokens":5019,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3203},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1b9f241b-d826-4a2c-acd9-bc50c1921e1c","uuid":"eb8a4e0a-65f0-48c4-bf69-0f3832b92364","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:12:44.199Z","request_id":"req_011Cfvaz2yKneUADzUpQw5Hy"}
